https://github.com/ixhadeel/holbertonschool-system_engineering-devops/blob/main/web_infrastructure_design/3-scale_up.png

## Additional Components
- An additional server improves infrastructure capacity.
- A second HAProxy provides load balancer redundancy.
- The HAProxy cluster uses failover to avoid a single load balancer failure.
- The web tier handles HTTP requests using Nginx.
- The application tier processes application logic independently.
- The database tier manages persistent data separately.

## Benefits
- Better resource isolation.
- Improved scalability.
- Higher availability through load balancer redundancy.
